#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/devices_and_distributed.md:1
msgid "Devices and Distributed Execution"
msgstr "设备与分布式执行"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/devices_and_distributed.md:3
msgid "RELIC centralizes Central Processing Unit (CPU) and Graphics Processing Unit (GPU) resolution in `relic.core.device_policy`. Scientific modules receive their final device from simulator registration and must not perform independent Compute Unified Device Architecture (CUDA) detection."
msgstr "RELIC 将中央处理器（Central Processing Unit, CPU）与图形处理器（Graphics Processing Unit, GPU）的设备解析集中收敛于 `relic.core.device_policy`。各科学计算模块在模拟器注册阶段接收最终分配设备，严禁在模块内部独立执行统一计算设备架构（Compute Unified Device Architecture, CUDA）可用性探测。"

