#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/devices_and_distributed.md:32
msgid "Accepted device requests are `auto`, `cpu`, `cuda`, `cuda:N`, and `torch.device` values. `auto` and tier-7 distributed default resolution prefer CUDA when available and fall back to CPU when CUDA is unavailable. `require_gpu=True` turns any CPU fallback or unavailable CUDA request into `RuntimeError`. An explicit `enable_distributed: true` setting that cannot be satisfied (unavailable distributed runtime, configuration validation errors, process-group setup failure, or a GPU `local_rank` without a visible CUDA device) raises immediately without silent fallback."
msgstr "受支持的设备请求值包括 `auto`、`cpu`、`cuda`、`cuda:N` 以及 `torch.device` 实例。`auto` 与第 7 层分布式默认解析策略在 CUDA 可用时优先选用 CUDA，不可用时回退至 CPU。设置 `require_gpu=True` 时，任何 CPU 回退或不可用的 CUDA 请求均会直接转化为 `RuntimeError`。当显式配置 `enable_distributed: true` 但运行条件无法满足（分布式运行时不可用、配置校验失败、进程组初始化失败，或 GPU `local_rank` 无可见 CUDA 设备）时，系统禁用静默降级并立即抛出异常。"

