#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/devices_and_distributed.md:261
msgid "On Windows, Gloo is the supported default. NVIDIA Collective Communications Library (NCCL) is CUDA-oriented and is not the normal Windows backend. Each multi-process launch must supply consistent address, port, world size, and unique ranks."
msgstr "在 Windows 平台上，Gloo 为受支持的默认通信后端；NVIDIA 集合通信库（NVIDIA Collective Communications Library, NCCL）面向 CUDA 环境，不作为 Windows 常规后端。每次启动多进程任务时，必须提供一致的通信地址、端口、全局进程总数（world size）以及互不重复的进程编号（rank）。"

