#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/devices_and_distributed.md:299
msgid "This context manager temporarily changes the simulator's distributed execution flag. It does not initialize a PyTorch process group, assign ranks, or launch worker processes. Call `init_distributed()` or use `distributed_context()` before relying on collectives."
msgstr "此上下文管理器临时更改模拟器的分布式执行标志。它不初始化PyTorch进程组，分配秩号，或启动工作进程。在依赖集体操作之前，请先调用`init_distributed()`或使用`distributed_context()`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/devices_and_distributed.md:304
msgid "Provider retirement and rank coordination"
msgstr "Provider 退役与 rank 协调"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/devices_and_distributed.md:306
msgid "Provider retirement is coordinated with device completion through the existing `relic.core.device_policy.DeviceFence` owner. A retired provider view remains retained until its readers have left and recorded device work has completed. Returning from a Python scheduling call alone does not establish completion of CUDA work. Lifecycle status and receipts distinguish waiting for readers, waiting for a device fence, disposal success, and disposal failure; supported disposal failures can be retried through the same lifecycle owner."
msgstr "Provider 退役通过现有的 `relic.core.device_policy.DeviceFence` owner 与 device 完成情况协调。已退役的 provider 视图会一直保留，直到其读者全部离开且已记录的 device 工作完成。仅从 Python 调度调用返回并不能确立 CUDA 工作已完成。生命周期状态与回执区分等待读者、等待 device fence、处置成功与处置失败；受支持的处置失败可通过同一生命周期 owner 重试。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/devices_and_distributed.md:314
msgid "With a real multi-rank process group and distributed execution enabled, registration and retirement use `relic.computation.distributed.launcher.coordinate_transaction`. Every rank prepares and votes on epoch, contract, binding, device, and random number generator (RNG) identity before application. Failed application triggers compensation and records its outcome. A missing peer, timeout, or divergent decision is observable; this protocol does not promise atomicity during partitions or tolerance of Byzantine ranks. It also does not provide a coordinated multi-rank checkpoint format."
msgstr "在真实多进程（multi-rank）进程组且启用分布式执行的条件下，模块注册与退役通过 `relic.computation.distributed.launcher.coordinate_transaction` 协调执行。各进程在正式生效前针对纪元（epoch）、契约、参数绑定、设备与随机数生成器（Random Number Generator, RNG）标识完成准备与投票；生效失败时触发补偿流程并记录补偿结果。对端缺失、通信超时或投票分歧均保持可观测；该协议不提供网络分区下的原子性保证，亦不具备拜占庭容错能力，且不提供跨多进程协同的单一检查点文件格式。"

